 "title": "Jivrus Technologies - GDPR",
 "description": "What is GDPR? The General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) is a European Union (EU) regulation that mandates how an organization should handle personal data. The General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) is aimed at giving citizens throughout the European Union (EU) control over their personal",
 "h1": "GDPR",
 "ogImage": "",
